# Close the loop

An agent is not done when the change “should work.” Finish the way this repo
already defines. Details live in the docs below — do not copy the constitution
into a rule; read it.

## 1. Read before editing

- [`docs/constitution.md`](docs/constitution.md) — non-negotiable principles.
- [`docs/session-handoff.md`](docs/session-handoff.md) — where we left off.
- UI work also reads [`.cursor/skills/lodestar-ui/SKILL.md`](.cursor/skills/lodestar-ui/SKILL.md).
- Index: [`AGENTS.md`](AGENTS.md).

## 2. Validate with tools, not with a story

- `npx tsc --noEmit`
- `npm run lint`
- When the dev server is up **and** the flow changed: `npm run smoke`

That is constitution Article III.4.

## 3. UI changes: click the running app

Use the **cursor-ide-browser** MCP (`browser_navigate`, `browser_lock`,
`browser_snapshot`, `browser_click`, `browser_take_screenshot`). Click through
the changed flow. A screenshot of a static screen is not validation.

- Dev is http://localhost:3000 (demo JSON store, no keys). Auth is production-only.
- QA after a UI pass: [`.cursor/skills/dogfood/SKILL.md`](.cursor/skills/dogfood/SKILL.md).
- Keyboard / focus / ARIA / contrast: [`.cursor/skills/accessibility/SKILL.md`](.cursor/skills/accessibility/SKILL.md).

Do not add MCP servers. Cloudflare and Stripe MCPs stay for those tasks only.

## 4. Write the memory in the same change

- Update [`docs/session-handoff.md`](docs/session-handoff.md).
- Non-trivial findings → [`docs/decisions/LEARNINGS.md`](docs/decisions/LEARNINGS.md).
- A real decision with alternatives → an ADR in [`docs/decisions/`](docs/decisions/)
  ([`.cursor/skills/adr-skill/SKILL.md`](.cursor/skills/adr-skill/SKILL.md)).

## 5. Commit and push — do not deploy unless asked

- Commit and `git push` to the current branch. Integration branch is **master**.
- Never force-push. Skip only when the user explicitly says not to.
- See [`.cursor/rules/git-commit-push.mdc`](.cursor/rules/git-commit-push.mdc).
- Do not deploy the Worker unless the task says to deploy.
- Deploy stays: `npm run cf:build`, then `$env:OPEN_NEXT_DEPLOY='true'; npx wrangler deploy`.
- Cursor stop hook (`.cursor/hooks.json`) nudges once if git is still dirty.
